{{> head}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/student.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portal.css"><body><main class="page" style="max-width:800px"><a class="text-link" href="/">← CareerBridge home</a><section class="card space-top"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT INFORMATION</p><h1>{{title}}</h1>{{#if privacy}}<h2>Information stored</h2><p>CareerBridge stores your account identity, academic profile, learning progress, submitted answers, course results, uploaded profile files and issued awards. Learning activity timing is an estimate, not proof of continuous study.</p><h2>Who can access it</h2><p>You can view your records. Assigned faculty can review students in their active sections; administrators manage accounts and system records. Credential verification links display the recipient, course, issue details and current award status.</p><h2>Google and optional AI</h2><p>Google sign-in verifies your Google account identity. This application does not request access to your Gmail messages. Career guidance sends anonymised scores and pathway evidence to Gemini only when you request it with consent. Course drafting sends the extracted teaching material shown in the faculty source review, also with consent.</p><h2>Files, sessions and record corrections</h2><p>Profile files are stored in the application database and require an authorised account to open. Session cookies keep you signed in for up to eight hours. Official ID and section changes require an Admin correction review. Contact your system administrator for access, record retention or privacy questions; the application does not automatically delete academic records.</p>{{else}}<h2>Use your own account</h2><p>Register using your own institutional details. Faculty accounts require administrator approval. Keep password-based credentials private and submit your own assessment work.</p><h2>Understand your results</h2><p>CareerBridge supports learning, assessment and career exploration. Faculty should validate course material, assessment rules and pathway requirements. Suggestions are not employment guarantees.</p><h2>Awards and feedback</h2><p>Course certificates record CareerBridge completion, not automatic TESDA or professional accreditation. Certificates can be revoked by Admin with a recorded reason. Contact your faculty when feedback or results need review.</p><h2>Respect teaching materials</h2><p>Upload material you have permission to use. Avoid confidential student records in AI source uploads, and ensure faculty can open any evidence links you submit.</p>{{/if}}<div class="actions space-top"><a class="button" href="/register">Create account</a><a class="button secondary" href="/login">Log in</a></div></section></main></body></html>
